#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1427 expect=violation domain=AC
#note "A CAGTCAT record carries ACVAL 'CHEMICAL' but AC holds no ACPARMCD='CHMTIDCD' record. FDA: \"'Chemical Agent Material Ident Code' (CHMTIDCD) record is expected in the Challenge Agent Characterization (AC) domain when the Parameter Value (ACVAL) for the 'Challenge Agent Category' (CAGTCAT) parameter is 'CHEMICAL'.\" -> the rule must fire exactly once for the dataset."
#library standard=sendig version=ar-1-0
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset AC label="Challenge Agent Characterization"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ACSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ACPARMCD type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter Short Name"
col ACPARM   type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter"
col ACVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | AC | 1 | CAGTCAT | Challenge Agent Category | CHEMICAL
S1 | AC | 2 | CAGTSUPN | Challenge Agent Supplier Name | ACME LABS
